OL,3,GNEWSA'We caught a family hiding plastic
OL,4,Ain their bread'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestaurants and pubs have reported
OL,7,Fhundreds of incidents of customers
OL,8,Frunning off without paying to Devon and
OL,9,FCornwall Police in recent years. The
OL,10,Fforce said it remained an under
OL,11,Freported crime and warned businesses
OL,12,Fwho have been victims off creating
OL,13,Ftheir own appeals on social media. We
OL,14,Fhave been to Newlyn in Cornwall to talk
OL,15,Fto publicans and restaurateurs about
OL,16,Ftheir experiences with dine and dash,
OL,17,Fand how they have dealt with it.
OL,19,F"We had a family who planted plastic in
OL,20,Ftheir piece of bread and then pretended
OL,21,Fthey had chipped their tooth biting
OL,22,Finto it."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
