OL,3,GNEWSA'We caught a family hiding plastic
OL,4,Ain their bread'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is just one incident of dine and
OL,7,Fdash Nina Maclean has experienced at
OL,8,Fher Mackerel Sky Seafood Bar in the
OL,9,Ftown in recent years.
OL,11,FAs well as capturing customers on CCTV
OL,12,Fplanting objects like plastic and hair
OL,13,Fin their food, others have run away
OL,14,Fwithout paying.
